Q. What is CloudFormation (Infrastructure as Code - IaC)?
A:	AWS CloudFormation is an Infrastructure as Code (IaC) service that lets you define and provision AWS resources using templates (JSON/YAML).
Instead of manually creating AWS resources via the console or CLI, you define them once in a template and CloudFormation automates the provisioning, configuration, and updates.
Feature
Description
IaC (Infrastructure as Code)
Define full AWS architecture in code
Template-Driven
YAML/JSON files define resources (EC2, S3, RDS, etc.)
Repeatable Deployments
Easily replicate environments (Dev, QA, Prod)
Secure & Auditable
Integrated with IAM, CloudTrail
Change Sets
Preview what changes will occur before applying
Stack Management
Group resources as a stack (create/update/delete as one unit)


